{"change_summary":"Added a canonical net-water-volume and concentration helper layer centered on `TankState`, backed by new `WaterState` concentration methods and `TankGeometry` substrate-displacement helpers. Implemented the required TAN, nitrite, nitrate, DOC, DIC, dissolved oxygen, phosphate, alkalinity, and `water_volume_l()` APIs; updated snapshot generation, stability seeding, water changes, scenario materialization, and core system paths to use the helpers instead of repeated raw `total / volume` math; and added deterministic plus property-based helper coverage. The bead `tanksim-6e5.2.2` was closed after validation.","outstanding_risks":["Kinetic normalization is still incomplete in systems whose Monod/half-saturation constants are intentionally still defined in total-mass terms; this change establishes the canonical helper layer but does not rename or retune those parameters yet.","`TankGeometry::water_volume_l()` still represents gross filled-prism volume for compatibility; canonical chemistry/exposure math should use `TankState::water_volume_l()` so future callers do not accidentally ignore substrate displacement."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected existing geometry, water, state, snapshot, scenario materialization, and system code to locate duplicated concentration math and current volume semantics.", "order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Implemented canonical helper APIs in the core types: substrate displacement and net water volume on `TankState`, volume-aware concentration helpers on `WaterState`, and supporting geometry helpers for substrate displacement.", "order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Refactored immediate call sites to consume the helpers, including snapshot export, stability tracking, water changes, shrimp/events/DO paths, density-based system calculations, and scenario water materialization/rescaling.", "order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added deterministic helper tests for known totals and edge cases, added a property test asserting helper outputs never go negative, updated affected scenario/water-change expectations, and ran repository validation.", "order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo test --quiet` completed successfully across the workspace.","`br lint` completed successfully with no template warnings.","Added `crates/tank_core/tests/concentration_helpers.rs`, which covers known total/volume conversions, zero-volume and empty-tank handling, very large tank behavior, and a property test for non-negative helper outputs.","Closed the backlog item with `br close tanksim-6e5.2.2 --reason=\"Completed\"`."]}